OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies to meet minister over
OL,4,Amaternity failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies affected by failings in
OL,7,Fmaternity and neonatal services at a
OL,8,Fhospital trust in Leeds are to meet the
OL,9,Fhealth secretary later to discuss their
OL,10,Fconcerns.
OL,12,FThe Leeds Maternity Families Group will
OL,13,Fmeet Yvette Cooper MP and government
OL,14,Fmaternity adviser Michelle Welsh
OL,15,Falongside Donna Ockenden, who is
OL,16,Fleading a review into maternity and
OL,17,Fneonatal services at Leeds Teaching
OL,18,FHospitals NHS Trust (LTHT).
OL,20,FThe families said they welcomed the
OL,21,Fopportunity to speak about the
OL,22,F"horrific failings" they experienced.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
